{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 64, :comments ["<b>And the sense of ותפול מעל הגמל [\"and she fell from upon the camel\"]:</b> Of her own will, like \"ויפול על פניו\" (Numbers 16:4). And the coming verse is earlier [in sequence], for ותאמר אל העבד [\"and she said to the servant\"] — but she had already spoken to the servant:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:45:42.173920148Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}